b_tag\" >Story</h2>Welcome to a world where humans and demons coexist. Souls harboring strong emotions and deep regrets at their time of death are transformed into archdemons. Archdemons have the power to corrupt the foundation of the world and contaminate their surroundings. Creatures tainted by this demonic power turn into lowly monsters that operate solely on raw instinct.<br>Faced with the threat to the world posed by five extremely powerful demon girls, the High Priestess is forced to dispatch Homura Hime—the &quot;Flame Princess&quot; and the strongest exorcist of them all—and her aide, Ann, who are now entrusted with the divine mission of purifying the world and defeating all demons.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1820000/extras/a4c6b36bb86e87807fa00ee8c820bcc2.poster.avif?t=1781518262\" width=1170 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1820000/extras/a4c6b36bb86e87807fa00ee8c820bcc2.webm?t=1781518262\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1820000/extras/a4c6b36bb86e87807fa00ee8c820bcc2.mp4?t=1781518262\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Immerse yourself in exhilarating and intense combo attack action<br></li><li>Survive challenging and beautiful 3D bullet hell attacks<br></li><li>Defeat archdemon girls to unlock special weapons and equipment<br></li><li>Take down the demons and reveal the truth about this world</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1820000/extras/02bd0fef4c245608da59beb66376e20c.poster.avif?t=1781518262\" width=1170 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_i